    "terrainName": "city-battle",
    "description": "What: On city-battle, four APCs ('Convoy 1'..'Convoy 4', 15 m apart) stand OFF the road in a column facing north at (100, 915..870), 39+ m south of the east-west road at y 954; 'Convoy 1' leads a road convoy (ConvoyOrder, Mode Route \u2014 our own route) to (560, 995), 41 m north of the same road; the other three follow it (Rank 1..3, Gap 15). Judge: (1) the lead runs PlatformConvoy; (2) it joins the road and drives it in its lane (city-battle's road net is imported from SUMO, so its lines ARE the driving lane: lane 0 at y 954.2 going east); (3) it leaves the road and reaches the target off-road; (4) the column never splits \u2014 the tail's lag behind its place stays under 40 m all the way; (5) the tail ends near the target too. Fail: a follower routes on its own, the column stretches apart, or the lead drives the centre line. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh cv-offroad-join-leave"
  },
